Subject: [PATCH] include <cstring> for ::memcpy in acceleration-structure-utils.h

The header calls ::memcpy but relies on a transitive include that libstdc++ does not
provide, so GCC on Linux fails with "'::memcpy' has not been declared". Upstreamable.

---
--- a/include/slang-rhi/acceleration-structure-utils.h
+++ b/include/slang-rhi/acceleration-structure-utils.h
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #include <slang-rhi.h>
 
+#include <cstring>
+
 namespace rhi {
 
 inline AccelerationStructureInstanceDescType getAccelerationStructureInstanceDescType(DeviceType deviceType)
